### AI微服务功能测试
### 测试learning-service中的AI功能与Python AI微服务的连接

# 前置条件：
# 1. Learning Service运行在 http://localhost:8084
# 2. Python AI Service运行在 http://localhost:8000
# 3. 请确保两个服务都已启动

### 1. 测试AI助手功能 - RAG问答
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/ai/rag/assistant
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 201

{
  "question": "什么是Spring Boot？",
  "context": "Java Web开发"
}

### 2. 测试练习生成功能 faillllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllll
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/ai/rag/generate_exercise
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 201

{
  "prompt": "生成5道关于Java基础的单选题，包含选项、答案和解析"
}

### 3. 测试主观题AI评分 faillllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllllll
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/ai/evaluate-subjective
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 201

{
  "question": "请简述Spring框架的优点",
  "student_answer": "Spring框架具有依赖注入、面向切面编程、轻量级等特点，能够简化Java企业级应用开发。",
  "reference_answer": "Spring框架的主要优点包括：1.依赖注入(IoC)降低组件耦合度；2.面向切面编程(AOP)实现横切关注点分离；3.轻量级框架，非侵入性；4.丰富的生态系统；5.良好的测试支持。"
}

